Cell["\<\
I have a function sol[1,4,x] defined by recursion relation, which I spend \
minutes to work it out.  Now I wish I could evaluate the function of x at \
some points , such as sol[1,4,1]. If I run\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]sol[1,4,1]\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] directly, It will go back to the recursion again and \
cost a lot of time. How to solve it?\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8826850936482363`*^9, 
  3.8826853206991177`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"324478ba-7818-4806-8703-\
abd0d43f2cc0"]
}, Open  ]],

